<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia IOI Properties net up 90 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia IOI Properties net up 90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		71.62	vs	 37.79</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)     57.92	vs	 33.40</p>
<p>    Turnover		 210.60	vs	102.92</p>
