<p>    Minorities	less   1.77	vs  less  0.11</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)     15.0	 vs	  8.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is IOI Properties Bhd.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
